  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICRC operations by the Washington (regional) Delegation(2025 Unaudited)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ICRC&apos;s Washington delegation promotes IHL, facilitates ICRC operations worldwide, and visits detainees in Guantanamo. It raises awareness of the ICRC&apos;s mandate, mobilizes support, facilitates IHL implementation and works closely with the American and Canadian Red Cross Societies.</narrative>
  </description>
